 "engine": "AppKit/ImageIO + PDFKit, XADMaster for archives; no video",
 "category": "comic",
 "summary": "Sequential is a classic open-source Mac image and comic viewer that opens folders, PDFs and archives (ZIP/CBZ, RAR/CBR, 7z) and pages through them in one window. The chuchusoft fork modernised it as a Universal app for macOS 11.4+ on Apple silicon; the maintainer says further development is unlikely. The original btrask/Sequential was last updated in 2013.",
 "where_it_wins": [
  "Reads PDFs page by page with Go to Page and an Invert Colors mode",
  "Right-to-left reading direction for manga",
  "Pause/Resume bookmarks a reading position inside an archive",
  "Many archive formats through XADMaster, including split 7z",
  "Runs on older macOS (10.14 Intel / 11.4 Apple silicon)"
 ],
 "where_schnellbild_wins": [
  "Plays videos, including MKV/AVI/WebM and videos inside archives",
  "Full thumbnail grid and list view instead of a sidebar",
  "Rename, move/copy, two panes, undo",
  "App Sandbox, no network, notarized and attested builds (Sequential needs the quarantine flag removed)",
  "Actively developed; AVIF/JPEG XL support",
  "Light/dark setting independent of the system"
 ],
